{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:691","content":{"id":691,"title":"合并区间","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"e9aa95b3-f945-4dfc-889b-3a15ce93632a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d9f4c1a7-bdde-4895-a68e-33c02ece9d0e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示若干个区间的集合，其中单个区间为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals[i] = [starti, endi]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。请你合并所有重叠的区间，并返回一个不重叠的区间数组，该数组需恰好覆盖输入中的所有区间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"904bcee6-fd18-47aa-bfb4-a1fb6641f552","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"cb229218-01ed-42d6-87ce-893bce9d55a0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"167298de-cda7-46bf-8937-96a04974011d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：intervals = [[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]]\n输出：[[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]]\n解释：区间 [1,3] 和 [2,6] 重叠, 将它们合并为 [1,6].","collabId":"7effe819-a743-472b-bf26-f8c27b84531d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"18189a07-b3d0-4be9-9d4b-be4cedf0c757","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"98740d3e-aec4-40a7-bd31-17268120c161","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"73eae991-f358-4388-93cd-b7c6ff2b1d66","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：intervals = [[1,4],[4,5]]\n输出：[[1,5]]\n解释：区间 [1,4] 和 [4,5] 可被视为重叠区间。","collabId":"50f0ef99-1fde-4d42-ad14-47919e195cab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f80ae730-0660-4788-912d-6760df121fa6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提示："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3dd140b5-ac3f-4033-a2c7-883e81f06eaf","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"eb9f7baa-ecda-4b0d-90cf-085c3a5e7af8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"772b13d4-f916-4c52-bd6b-1c8e52a26b42","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals.length >= 1"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"49243e43-2d7d-404a-b504-6eff12d407fb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3889c3f2-e3a5-46d4-8b5f-857ae88d08e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals[0].length == 2"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c713fc67-78ae-49d7-9599-1878f8e6768e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5700fd3e-7ceb-43a2-a8f6-d9a31cc1e2e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先第一步我们将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"intervals"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组按照区间的起点进行从小到大排序，排序后相邻的两个区间 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"[s_1, e_1], [s_2, e_2]","collabId":"3ead6ee7-44a9-4f7f-8880-24a4fae59103","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[s_1, e_1], [s_2, e_2]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"s_2 \\leq e_1","collabId":"77aa7283-331f-41f3-acb7-2944fe8f11f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"s_2 \\leq e_1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的时候，我们就可以认为两个区间是重叠的，区间就可以合并为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"[s_1, \\max\\{ e_1, e_2 \\}]","collabId":"8eaeed8f-054d-4a4e-96d0-88720e63d570","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/b99605c6c961b508d2b223f42e823470_a4f8ff43-8f33-4d70-b01d-87c8f21e9dcd.gif","uuid":"2a77ec2a-b1ff-487e-8aad-43fb73d102b2","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/b99605c6c961b508d2b223f42e823470_a4f8ff43-8f33-4d70-b01d-87c8f21e9dcd.gif","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"72c720b9-e609-4af3-ad70-c410a07f9049","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0714075b-7b3b-4dc7-88d0-bc22e07c8e8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在这里我们使用双指针，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示合并区间的开头，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"t"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示合并区间的结尾，当区间可以合并时，则更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"t = max{e1, e2}"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当区间不能合并时，将新的区间 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[start, t]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 添加到返回的数组中，并且更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"t"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting2/raw/master/20210502122418.gif","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting2/raw/master/20210502122418.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"7924ed53-99df-4c59-a54e-9409513aba2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"09a39608-93cc-4d29-891b-2e66a2f79d57","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"de9ca469-35eb-4120-b706-a6efbf56d9b5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int[][] merge(int[][] intervals) {\n    List<int[]> lists = new ArrayList<>();\n    // 对 intervals 排序，如果区间起点相同，则按照区间终点排\n    Arrays.sort(intervals, (a, b) -> a[0] - b[0] == 0 ? a[1] - b[1] : a[0] - b[0]);\n\n    int start = intervals[0][0];\n    int t = intervals[0][1];\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < intervals.length; i++) {\n        if (intervals[i][0] <= t) {\n            t = Math.max(t, intervals[i][1]);\n        } else {\n            lists.add(new int[]{start, t});\n            start = intervals[i][0];\n            t = intervals[i][1];\n        }\n    }\n    lists.add(new int[]{start, t});\n\n    int[][] merges = new int[lists.size()][2];\n    int i = 0;\n    for (int[] item: lists) {\n        merges[i++] = item;\n    }\n\n    return merges;\n}","collabId":"8e115e6f-e301-4e7b-b0f0-ecb47a79a078","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6e4d36bc-5fd8-4ca0-9c2f-adc9ac9c69a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"38b14437-f4e8-4b4a-a62a-e39ba73a3660","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"40b3b7cd-92b8-4ea1-88e2-d8d38bb645b9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dfb88b1e-e17b-4ea4-94eb-574dbf5e44cb","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/merge-intervals/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"9e6c095f-a3d2-42b9-86cc-68a538319f76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"合并区间"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"双指针"},{"label":"合并区间","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:691","type":"doc","id":691}}],"prevPage":{"title":"三数之和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:683","type":"doc","id":683}},"nextPage":{"title":"删除有序数组中的重复项","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:701","type":"doc","id":701}},"createTime":1728999697840,"updateTime":1775928993276,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775928993276}}